SUMMARY:Haley Heynderickx w/ John Roseboro
DESCRIPTION:Haley Heynderickx makes the kind of music that makes you want t
 o slow down and pay attention. With a voice that is both intimate and capt
 ivating\, her songs find beauty in the everyday while exploring identity\,
  belonging\, nature\, and all the uncertainty that comes with being human.
  We're thrilled to have her taking over our City Hall stage! Tender\, thou
 ghtful\, and quietly spellbinding\, Heynderickx’s live performances crea
 te an experience that feels less like a concert and more like stepping int
 o a brand new story. Join us and leave with just a little more room for wo
 nder! Opening the evening is John Roseboro! Based in Brooklyn\, New York\,
  Roseboro has cultivated a sound that exists outside conventional genre bo
 undaries—melding Brazilian bossa nova and MPB\, indie folk\, jazz\, soul
 \, alternative rock\, and devotional music into what he has described as "
